# Matlab
*.m
*.lock

# Quarto intermediates for the tutorial decks (sources live in docs/tutorials/).
# These are local build products; the published copy is handled below.
docs/tutorials/*/_site/
docs/tutorials/*/.quarto/
docs/tutorials/*/slides-standalone.html

# The *published* tutorial output under docs/_static/tutorials/ must be committed
# verbatim: the Sphinx build only copies docs/_static, it never runs Quarto, so
# this tree is what the website actually serves.
#
# It is mostly vendored web assets (reveal.js, bootstrap), whose directory and
# file names collide with generic rules above — `dist/` swallows reveal.js's
# entire core, and `*.wav` would swallow any audio a deck embeds. Re-include the
# whole subtree, then put back the exclusions that still make sense inside it.
# (Note the path: docs/_static/tutorials/ is the output, docs/tutorials/ above is
# the source. Do not mix them up.)
!docs/_static/tutorials/**
docs/_static/tutorials/**/.DS_Store
docs/_static/tutorials/**/__pycache__/
